## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | BLOCKING | js/unit-tests/test_instructionRefs.js | 🚨 blocking ci red — crap ratchet fails on walk quality job exit 2 the crap check fails on head 980ac31a ci failures md new 8 js unit tests test instructionrefs js walk 15 0 regression s 1 new over threshold 0 improvement s 0 removed error process completed with exit code 2 the new v1shimindex helper test instructionrefs js 200 inlines one walk closure carrying all of the branch work the file list shape normalization dotfile skip the file exists dual shape dir test ex true ex typeof ex object ex exists true the md dir fork the banner cut ternary the missing banner continue and the livepat exec loop — cc lands the function over the crap 8 threshold at its measured coverage fix per the repo s crap split convention extract small pure helpers — e g isdirentry ex shimbannerpaths txt returns the live paths named by a banner and a per entry step — and pin each with direct unit tests or extend r13 s fixtures so walk s branches run under the coverage harness either way the ratchet must go green everything else in this pr is already green unit suite 10807 passed 0 failed |
| F2 | open | IMPORTANT | scripts/validate-review-skills.js | ⚠️ important validator resolves skill file lens paths against the wrong root — false fails on the documented consuming repo layout scripts validate review skills js resolves every path through toreporelative path join reporoot p lines 112–131 but the factory skill files lens field carries a pack relative path instructions pr review generalist lens md in this checkout the two roots coincide so the ci step passes — but the script s own documented usage is the consuming repo from the consuming repo root with the agents pack available header factorydirs even defaults to agents instructions review line 90 with the pack at agents readfile looks for reporoot instructions pr review generalist lens md while the file lives at reporoot agents instructions — the read misses and the check 3 split lines 162–169 promotes lens file missing or empty from warning to hard error → exit 1 reproduced against a product repo layout agents → this pack a dmtools config js carrying reviewpolicy required ✅ reviewer base factory — lens instructions pr review generalist lens md required true ❌ base lens file missing or empty instructions pr review generalist lens md ❌ security lens file missing or empty instructions pr review security lens md reviewer pool 2 reviewer s validated · 2 error s 0 warning s ❌ validate review skills failed exit 1 — lenses exist unfixable via factory repo flags suggested fix resolve factory owned paths lens and any skill file path against the discovered packroot fall back reporoot relative for repo authored dmtools review paths — those are genuinely repo root relative e g the valid fixture s dmtools review legal lens md a repo vs pack discriminator at the io bag keeps the pure resolvepool contract unchanged and lets a downstream repo actually use its §8 gate |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

